What file was observed on Richard Clement's machine immediately after he downloaded the file in question 16? Provide the full path.
let richard_host=
Employees
| where name == "Richard Clements"
| project hostname;
FileCreationEvents
| where hostname in (richard_host)
| where timestamp > datetime(2023-03-04T07:50:39.7612800Z)
Answer: C:\ProgramData\NotASpy\yeargood.exe

What was the SHA256 hash of the file in question 17?
Answer: 3666cb55d0c4974bfee855ba43d596fc6d10baff5eb45ac8b6432a7d604cb8e9

What is the reported name of this file on VirusTotal?
Answer: ISDQKWGM.dll

What is the popular threat label for the file in question 18 on VirusTotal?
Answer: virus.eicar/test

How many processes were spawned on Richard Clement's machine by the file in question 18?
let richard_host=
Employees
| where name == "Richard Clements"
| project hostname;
ProcessEvents
| where hostname in (richard_host)
| where timestamp >= datetime(2023-03-04T07:50:58.7612800Z)
| where parent_process_name contains "yeargood"
Answer: 2

The file in question 18 established a remote connection from Richard Clement's machine to an external IP over port 443. What was this IP?
Answer: 118.3.14.33

Shortly after the malware ran, the attackers came back to Richard's machine to enumerate Enterprise Admins. What command did they run?
Answer: cmd.exe /C net group /domain 'Enterprise Admins'

What command did the attackers run to dump credentials on Richard's machine?
Answer: mimikatz

The attackers enumerated the contents of a folder on Richard's machine, then dumped its content to a text file. What was the name of that folder?
Answer: BalloonSecrets

How many machines have similar commands connecting to C2 (command and control) channels as the one observed in question 22?
ProcessEvents
| where process_commandline contains ":443" and process_commandline contains "rundll32.exe"
| distinct hostname
Answer: 36

How many unique implants were used to establish these C2 connections?
ProcessEvents
| where process_commandline contains ":443" and process_commandline contains "rundll32.exe"
| distinct parent_process_hash
Answer: 11

One of these C2 connections was observed on hostname 0KYU-DESKTOP. When did this occur?
ProcessEvents
| where process_commandline contains ":443" and process_commandline contains "rundll32.exe"
| where hostname == "0KYU-DESKTOP"
Answer: 2023-03-04T09:19:33.7612800Z

On hostname 0KYU-DESKTOP, what commands did the attackers run to delete data backups?
ProcessEvents
| where hostname == "0KYU-DESKTOP"
| where timestamp > datetime(2023-03-04T09:19:33.7612800Z)
Answer: vssadmin.exe Delete Shadows /all /quiet

What kind of attack could this be a sign of?
Answer: ransomware


